<title>AUSTRIA: BBAG sees 96 pretax at over 1 bln ATS.</title>
<headline>BBAG sees 96 pretax at over 1 bln ATS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's leading brewery and beverages group Oesterreichische Brau-Beteiligungs AG said on Wednesday 1996 preliminary pre-tax profit stood at over one billion schillings, compared with 771 million last year.</p>
<p>The company said it expected group turnover at 10 billion schillings, against 11.08 billion in 1995.</p>
